<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;">We miss you at Parinaam</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Dear {{firstName}}, it has been over a year since you last joined a Goodhearts session, so we have marked your volunteer account <strong>inactive</strong>. You will not be able to sign in or receive session invitations while it stays that way.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Nothing is lost: your volunteering record — hours, trainings and certificates — is kept safely and comes back the moment your account is reactivated.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;"><strong>Want to return?</strong> Just write to <a href="mailto:admin@parinaam.org">admin@parinaam.org</a> and we will reactivate your account — the communities you served would love to see you again.</p>
<p style="margin:0;color:#5E6E7E;font-size:13px;">Thank you for every hour you have given. The door is always open.</p>
